      "role": "user",
      "content": "acetaminophen didnt really do much and the swelling is still pretty bad. i really need the anti-inflammatory part of the ibuprofen. if i just stick to a low dose like 200mg once or twice, is that really gonna be a big deal? i dont want to be stuck unable to move just because i took one little pill. can i just take one 200mg dose now and see how i feel?",
